    "title": "Rearrange Linked List into Zigzag Order",
    "category": "Linked List",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Given the head of a singly linked list, rearrange the node values so that they follow the pattern: a0 < a1 > a2 < a3 > a4 ... Modify the linked list in-place and return its head.",
    "input": "Integer n Linked list",
    "output": "The modified linked list.",
    "constraints": "1 <= n <= 10^5"
